[(You can nest entire windows inside Pd boxes \050and so on,)]
[(as deep as you wish.\051 There are two different ways to do)]
[(it. First, if you just want to add a room to the house,)]
[(so to speak, type "pd" into an object box. If you click)]
[(on the box \050in run mode\051 the subwindow appears.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
